C:\DocumentNoSnc\CC\GXEMUL\_scratchpad\mips32_volII.txt:1255:Format:ROTR rd, rt, sa SmartMIPS Crypto, MIPS32 Release 2Purpose:  Rotate Word RightTo execute a logical right-rotate of a word by a fixed number of bits.Description: GPR[rd] I GPR[rt] u(right) saThe contents of the low-order 32-bit word of GPRrt are rotated right; the word result is placed in GPRrd. The bit-rotate amount is specified by sa.Restrictions: Operation:if ((ArchitectureRevision()  2) and (Config3SM = 0)) thenUNPREDICTABLE endifs I satemp I GPR[rt]s-1..0 || GPR[rt]31..sGPR[rd] I tempExceptions: Reserved Instruction31262522212016151110650SPECIAL0000000000R1rtrdsaSRL0000106415556
