codex
The local MIPS64 manual corrects another premise: plain `DEXT` permits `pos + size <= 63`, not `<= 32`. It explicitly says there is no UNPREDICTABLE field case for `DEXT`. Both variant adjustments match the manual; I’m checking dispatch paths and machine defaults to establish reachability.
